      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَادٌ</span></b>  <i>Heavy:</i> (K:) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَادِىٌّ</span></b>  <i>firm,</i> or
